Changes in version 0.99.0 (2026-08-23)
+ Package released with the Phase 1 matrix model
  (population-level isoform deconvolution X ~ AB with fixed A)
+ Phase 2 tensor model (model="tensor"): individual-specific
  cell-type-resolved isoform abundance via plain partial non-negative
  Tucker decomposition, fitted by block multiplicative updates with
  fixed A; warnings for generically non-identifiable rank regimes
